id: pm-s32gcz
title: Keep aggregate test execution complete when legacy commands are refused
description: "The assignment/comment-only preflight correctly throws before execution, but test-all batches currently propagate that exception and discard earlier item results. Convert these legacy entries into per-test config_refusal results, execute the remaining tests, and preserve result ordering, deduplication, totals and durable per-item tracking."
