author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 45
parent: pm-gh1555
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Convert known assignment/comment-only entries into owner-specific config_refusal results before scheduling or deduplication; retain their result positions, run the remaining commands, and preserve aggregate totals and per-item tracking."
expected_result: "A legacy invalid entry cannot pass or abort test-all, valid tests and later items execute, and refused rows and tracking accurately identify each affected item."
actual_result: "83 linked tests pass. A four-item10-link regression preserves4 passes,5 refusals and1 skip with correct per-item tracking; the real CLI returns complete dependency-failed JSON and no default data writes. Unrelated errors propagate. Type, lint, source quality, generated contracts and docs links pass. Exact revised-head hosted checks and renewed reviews remain merge conditions."
