  "2026-10-23T14:05:57.718Z","harness:codex","text=Duplicate check: request-specific live search, open/in_progress lists, a fresh complete3078-item all-status snapshot and full delivered dedupe/liveness lineage reads found no active owner for this new guard-consumer regression. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1559#discussion_r4360363229. Retain shared fail-closed command admission and adapt the aggregate consumer."
  "2026-10-23T14:10:42.609Z","harness:codex","Negative controls: the unchanged SDK batch throws linked_test_command_not_executable after the earlier valid item, and the real CLI returns a usage refusal instead of a complete dependency-failed result. Both new regressions fail on the intended behavior. Filter known command-admission refusals before scheduling or deduplication, retain their original result positions and owner IDs, and propagate unrelated errors unchanged. Validate invalid-only and mixed items, repeated invalid entries, valid duplicates, later execution and persisted per-item summaries."
  "2026-10-23T14:16:26.935Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence:83 linked tests pass with a durable receipt. The complete four-item SDK control has10 links and returns4 real passes,5 config refusals and1 valid duplicate skip; invalid-only and mixed items retain ordered results, later commands execute, and every item records the correct pass/fail summary. The CLI control returns a complete dependency-failed JSON result and leaves item/history bytes unchanged with tracking disabled. Unrelated guard errors propagate. Type, lint, source quality, generated SDK/error/capability and documentation-link checks pass. All three in-repository runLinkedTests definition/call locations were inspected; the direct runner guard remains in place."
